msgstr "un tampon de type bytes contenant les échantillons."

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.utils.rst:66
msgid ""
"Convert a buffer of ``int32`` samples into a float :class:`numpy.ndarray` in"
" one pass."
msgstr ""
"Convertit un tampon d'échantillons ``int32`` en un :class:`numpy.ndarray` de"
" flottants en une seule passe."

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.utils.rst:87
msgid ""
"Convert a buffer of ``uint32`` samples into a float :class:`numpy.ndarray` "
"in one pass."
msgstr ""
"Convertit un tampon d'échantillons ``uint32`` en un :class:`numpy.ndarray` "
